(The ledger's buffer leaves, batch B, 2026-08-29 evening -
 docs/ledger/buffers.md rows BUF-41, BUF-42, BUF-43, BUF-44, BUF-45,
 BUF-46, BUF-47, BUF-48, BUF-51, BUF-52 - the "Releasing a Buffer"
 subsection. Same shape as 300_gen_buffers_a.vox and 330_gen_buffers_b.vox
 (that file's own name already belongs to the night-of-08-28 kinds
 105-109, so this batch's tests are 430_gen_buffers_c): each leaf is
 called directly off a pinned rng seed and its emitted source printed in
 full, the golden is the generated Vox itself, at the true top level
 (nested false) and inside a block (nested true) both.

 'gen leaf buffer freed write refused' (BUF-47) gets two seeds: one with
 gen_does_file_io left false, so the fifth ("Read ... into") form stands
 aside and only the other four render, and one with it (and
 gen_scratch_flag) turned on, the same way 380_gen_files_b.vox does it,
 so the fifth form's golden is on record too.

 'gen leaf buffer free spellings' and 'gen leaf buffer freed resize
 refused' loop 1-3 times, so each gets two seeds to show more than one
 iteration count in the golden.)

Print "--- BUF-41, BUF-42: Free/Release/Deallocate, with or without the article ---".
'rng seed' of 110.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer free spellings' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, a different seed (a different buffer count) ---".
'rng seed' of 111.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer free spellings' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 110.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer free spellings' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BUF-43, BUF-44, BUF-45: size/length/capacity/empty/full/as-text after Free ---".
'rng seed' of 112.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer freed state' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 112.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer freed state' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BUF-46: a byte read past a freed buffer is refused and reads 0 ---".
'rng seed' of 113.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer freed read refused' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 113.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer freed read refused' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BUF-47: append/Set byte/copy/set refused after Free (no file I/O this run) ---".
'rng seed' of 114.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer freed write refused' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 114.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer freed write refused' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BUF-47 again, with file I/O available - the fifth form (Read ... into) ---".
Set gen_scratch_flag to "'the workspace'".
Set gen_does_file_io to true.
'rng seed' of 114.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer freed write refused' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.
Set gen_does_file_io to false.

Print "--- BUF-48: resize/reallocate/grow/shrink refused after Free ---".
'rng seed' of 115.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer freed resize refused' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, a different seed (a different buffer count) ---".
'rng seed' of 116.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer freed resize refused' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 115.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer freed resize refused' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BUF-51: a second Free is a no-op that flags rather than crashing ---".
'rng seed' of 117.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer double free' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 117.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer double free' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BUF-52: freeing a buffer through a parameter frees the caller's own variable ---".
'rng seed' of 118.
'gen buffer names reset'.
'gen reset value names'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer free via parameter' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 118.
'gen buffer names reset'.
'gen reset value names'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer free via parameter' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.
